     "en": [
      "learn to tolerate boring repetition"
     ],
     "texte": "1. [[White Nights]], Dostoevsky"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "most success is less",
      "exciting than it looks"
     ],
     "texte": "four nights, two strangers on a bridge"
