     "texte": "she's waiting for someone else, and you still [[hope for him on every page]]"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "consistency gets powerful when other people get bored",
      "and move on"
     ],
     "texte": "about 70 pages, [[the shortest heartbreak you'll ever read]]"
