  "3": {
   "textes": {
    "T1": {
     "en": [
      "scrolling whenever you're bored"
     ],
     "texte": "2. [[The Alchemist]], Coelho"
    },
    "T2": {
     "en": [
      "you can lose 2–3 hours a day without even noticing,",
      "then wonder why you have no time for the things you",
      "care about"
     ],
     "texte": "a young shepherd dreams of a treasure near the pyramids, sells his sheep and leaves, and [[the road teaches him more than gold]]"
    },
    "T3": {
     "en": [
      "be deliberate with your",
      "time."
     ],
     "texte": "under 200 pages, [[one weekend]]"
    },
    "T4": {
     "en": [
      "i personally use readup to",
      "block tiktok until i read for",
      "20 minutes, which keeps",
      "me from mindlessly scrolling"
     ],
     "texte": "what replaced my scrolling: a book in my bag, music on walks, and [[the Sophia app]] when i grab my phone anyway"
    },
    "T5": {
     "en": [
      "your phone can wait until",
      "you have done one thing",
      "you meant to do."
     ],
     "texte": "today's 5 min lesson there: why the renaissance was born in italy"
    }
   },
   "images": {
    "I1": "sophia_capture"
   }
